  "observations": [
    "UsualGroup TitleFont is supported; Font and TextColor are discarded by native normalization. Title font is not inherited by the nested inputs.",
    "Representation=None keeps ShowTitle=true and uses a 10pt heading; the default/WeakSeparation heading is 12pt.",
    "StrongSeparation uses a 2px left line in the title color and a 10px content indent, without a horizontal top rule.",
    "Explicit BackColor adds 5px group padding; input backgrounds remain independently white.",
    "Designer shows Collapsed=true contents expanded. The title is underlined and the nested items indented by 10px.",
    "ButtonGroup and Popup directly under the form render no pixels; the same elements inside a CommandBar are visible.",
    "The Popup opens two 30px menu items in a 210px menu; the active fill is #facc1f. Menu activation selects design-time elements without executing a command.",
    "StyleItem font 12pt bold plus inline italic retains all three settings; TitleFont height=10 overrides size while retaining the referenced bold setting."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Other group/page representations, orientation, nesting, stretch and styling combinations.",
    "Nested command menus, separators, automatically supplied command sources, and per-item styles.",
    "Full native pixel comparison including fonts, shell selection borders, icons and every supported OS.",
    "Measured default fonts do not close other faces/sizes, all caption positions, button states, tab skins, or table command-source combinations."
  ],
