  "testRunNotes": [
    "A click exposed DataCloneError when a Solid store proxy was sent to VS Code. The client now unwraps outgoing messages; a browser-bundled controller regression test exercises structuredClone.",
    "Host checks wait for caption font allocation before reading button geometry. At 200% Chromium returns local CSS units; the zoom check verifies the unchanged CSS width and applied zoom, not a doubled getBoundingClientRect width.",
    "Applying the earlier 12px table padding to integral caption advances exposed a 3px search regression. Native side borders confirmed 13px ordinary padding, and automatic More has a different gap from explicit Popup. Fixed-width buttons cannot flex-shrink. Both locale tables retain their native 172px search."
  ],
